# NOTE: The old rule here — "/episode/* /content/:splat 301" — was
# permanently redirecting every single episode page to a mismatched
# /content/:id URL before the app even ran. That meant Google (and users)
# could never actually reach /episode/:id pages directly, which is very
# likely a major reason episode pages were not getting indexed.
#
# The episode.$id.tsx route is a real, working page with its own SEO meta
# tags — it should be served directly, not redirected away. No redirects
# are needed here right now.
